I was using both secr (for D) and openCR (phi, f, lambda) to estimate some parameters for a bear population and I want to use roughly equivalent models for both programs.  I am using the bk parameterization on a0 in secr but want to make sure that the bk parameterization in openCR is similar.  My understanding is that bk in secr takes effect after the first capture at a particular site and persists through the sampling year but does not carry across years.  What would be the equivalent model in openCR?  Thanks!

